ng doses reported by each registrant.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"The threshold for statistical significance was p<0.05.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"SAS software (version 9.4; SAS Institute) was used for all analyses.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 2\", \"q\": \"Percentage of registrants who reported a reaction or health impact at least once during days 0–7 after vaccination.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}